{{!-- Subject: {{ref_line}} - ETA Notices Required --}}

{{!--
  Party names, never mailbox addresses. The client returned this notice marked
  up because the header printed the recipients' raw e-mail addresses
  (prakhar.galgale@ril.com; …) — those belong in the envelope, not in the
  letter. to_recipients / cc_recipients are the address lists and must not be
  printed here.

  The two are asymmetric, deliberately (see nominations.service.ts):
    to_parties — the VALUE of the To line, one line, "Attn:" already padded
                 into a fixed column. The label is written here.
    cc_parties — WHOLE lines, one "Cc: <company>" per owner/operator, already
                 carrying their own label, because a template cannot prefix
                 each line of a multi-line value. Do not add a second "Cc:".
--}}
{{#if to_parties}}
To: {{to_parties}}
{{/if}}
{{#if cc_parties}}
{{cc_parties}}
{{/if}}
Fm: Servicios Navieramar, C.A. (as Agent Only)
Ref: {{ref_line}}
{{#if laycan}}
Laycan: {{laycan}}
{{/if}}
{{#if cargo_quantity}}
Load: {{cargo_quantity}} {{cargo_unit}} {{cargo_grade}} +/- 10%
{{/if}}

Good day, dear Master {{master_name}},

